 "audition": [
  "the whole file: one procedure, never stopping -- does it ever feel like a loop that nags?",
  "1.9-23.3 s: the pedal and the whisper under the firing, told from their side: dignified, not villainous; the clockwork creeping back under \"super.\"",
  "23.3 s: Step Four on the pen's run; the blank F held under the blog post",
  "108.3-124.7 s: the Door's head and the choir in the glass: a cathedral, never a church",
